00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,307
Jason paid for a box that was supposed
to contain cash. Inside, Lucia

2
00:00:05,307 --> 00:00:06,940
found somebody's emergency instead.

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:11,839
Sealed medicine packets filled the
tackle box. A folded receipt named a

4
00:00:11,839 --> 00:00:13,880
